abstract: >
  An integrated GeoAI platform combining eight modular engines into a
  single pipeline that takes a place name and produces an integrated
  environmental risk assessment, with three custom-trained machine
  learning models for cloud detection, land cover refinement, and
  wildfire risk calibration.
